            <div class="_9-col">
              <div class="flex vertical gap-0-5 relative">
                <h3 class="h4">Made Clear is the cardiology content agency. </h3>
                <p class="split-lines text-color-fade">Mike Clear set up Made Clear having spent years in some of London&#x27;s most creative agencies, including Mother, Saatchi &amp; Saatchi, DigitasLBi, and ZenithOptimedia, as a creative content producer. Before founding Made Clear, he led the content studio at Wondr Medical, one of the most ambitious medical knowledge networks ever built, where he developed both a deep understanding of how clinicians consume and share knowledge, and relationships with physicians across the world.</p>
                <p class="split-lines text-color-fade">That experience convinced him that medical content could benefit from far greater creativity. He resolved to reach audiences differently, making content more engaging and memorable, leading to better understanding, better recall, and ultimately better patient outcomes.</p>
                <p class="split-lines text-color-fade">Since then, Made Clear has worked with many of the leading MedTech companies in the world, including Abbott, Philips, Medtronic, Shockwave, Johnson &amp; Johnson, and many leading physicians.</p>
                <p class="split-lines text-color-fade">Today, we partner with organisations to develop and deliver content experiences that land with audiences: from educating physicians and sales reps about device MoA with VR, engaging HCPs with medical influencers on social media, to inspiring patients with hospital welcomes, and much in between. We plan, create and distribute crystal clear and compelling content.</p>
              </div>
