                <div class="relative flex justify-center">
                  <h2 class="relative">Our philosophy</h2><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Vector-5.svg" alt="" class="vector-bg">
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="_9-col">
              <div class="flex vertical gap-0-5">
                <h3 class="h4">We believe extraordinary science deserves extraordinary storytelling. </h3>
                <p class="split-lines text-color-fade">The stakes are real. The audiences are intelligent. So why settle for content that&#x27;s merely correct? </p>
                <p class="split-lines text-color-fade">Having worked at London&#x27;s most creative agencies, Mike Clear left advertising with a simple conviction: that medical content deserved the same ambition, craft, and storytelling as the best communication anywhere. That the science was good enough. The stories were there. They just needed to be told properly.</p>
                <p class="split-lines text-color-fade">Important ideas need to be clear enough to be understood, and compelling enough to be remembered. When they are, behaviour changes. Decisions change. Outcomes change. And in cardiology, that really matters.</p>
                <p class="split-lines text-color-fade">That&#x27;s what Made Clear is for.</p>
                <p class="split-lines"></p>
                <p class="split-lines"></p>
