                <h2>YOU ARE</h2>
                <div class="max-w-440">
                  <p>An interventional or structural heart company with something important to say. A new device, a clinical breakthrough, a congress moment, a training need. </p>
                  <p>You know your science inside out. What you need is someone who can turn it into content that changes how clinicians think and act. </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>
            <section class="_6-col opacity-hover is-second">
              <div class="flex vertical gap-3-5 t_gap-2">
                <div class="flex vertical gap-2 t_gap-1-25">
                  <h2 class="h1">WE ARE</h2>
                  <div>
                    <p>The cardiology content agency that speaks your language. We know congress cycles. We understand KOL dynamics. We recognise the internal politics and approval processes that shape what gets made and what gets shelved. We don&#x27;t need the context explained.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div data-w-id="7d6b8873-181f-6e75-ea99-d530b7330f20" class="flex vertical gap-1-25 the-first">
                  <div>
                    <p class="h3">MIKE CLEAR</p>
                    <div class="text-size-xsmall text-italicize-italic font-500">Founder &amp; Managing Director</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex vertical gap-0-25">
                    <p>Mike spent twenty years at the heart of the UK&#x27;s creative industry, training at Mother London and leading content at DigitasLBi and ZenithOptimedia. </p>
                    <p>At Wondr Medical he led the content studio for what was then one of the world&#x27;s most ambitious medical knowledge networks.</p>
                    <p>In 2023 he founded Made Clear Studios, bringing everything he&#x27;d learned about what makes content land and applying it to the science that deserves it most.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div data-w-id="fedba6a1-ab9b-301c-2c03-8769a62852f0" class="flex vertical gap-1-25 the-second">
                  <div>
                    <p class="h3">OLLY MORLEY-NORRIS</p>
                    <div class="text-size-xsmall text-italicize-italic font-500">Head of Digital &amp; Delivery</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex vertical gap-0-25">
                    <p>Olly is the person who makes sure that what gets conceived actually gets made; on time, to brief, and to a standard that Made Clear can be proud of.</p>
                    <p>He&#x27;s spent his career at the intersection of digital and delivery, working across The Economist, Hogarth Worldwide, and Wondr Medical before joining Made Clear. He knows how complex projects move through organisations: the dependencies, the stakeholders, the moments where things quietly go sideways if nobody&#x27;s paying attention.</p>
                    <p>He&#x27;s the one paying attention.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div data-w-id="a7c89417-3c70-68d5-5da9-22a31642eec9" class="flex vertical gap-1-25 the-third">
                  <div>
                    <p class="h3">ALANNA CLEAR</p>
                    <div class="text-size-xsmall text-italicize-italic font-500">Head of Strategy</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex vertical gap-0-25">
                    <p>Alanna started her career in advertising and spent years at the sharp end of brand strategy, working on clients including the BBC and Sainsbury&#x27;s. She was lead strategist for the ambitious BT rebrand and has worked with organisations of all sizes across all sectors.</p>
                    <p>She and Mike also drove a motorbike and sidecar 20,000 miles from Alaska to Argentina interviewing couples about what makes marriages last, turned it into an award-winning documentary, and featured in the national press of every country along the way.</p>
                    <p>Her route into healthcare was deliberate. After serving as CMO of Added Health, a B2B and NHS-supporting health coaching app, she joined Made Clear as Head of Strategy, bringing the rigour of a senior brand strategist to a world where the stakes are higher than most. She is also a Board Trustee of the 1001 Critical Days Foundation, championing the importance of early childhood development.</p>
                    <p>Her job at Made Clear is to make sure the thinking is as good as the making.</p>
